_url":"https://gitcode.com/sangzhenguo"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176848670,"discussion_id":"858f502350cab78b1fa81dcf09ea29d07af2a9ff","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 mmrs（matmul_reduce_scatter）算子中 bias 偏移计算错误的问题，涉及 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_dequant.h` 和 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_smallM.h` 两个 kernel 头文件。修正在反量化（dequant）通路中 `BiasType` 指针偏移量的计算方式，确保 bias 向量在分块处理时能够正确对齐到对应的数据列位置。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_dequant.h` 中 bias 偏移修正**：调整了 `DequantRunner::RunMatmulReduceScatter` 中 `gmBiasOffset` 的计算逻辑，使 bias 指针偏移与当前分块的 N 维度坐标正确对应（+4/-3 行）。\n- **`matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_smallM.h` 中 bias 偏移修正**：调整了 `MatmulReduceScatterAivModeSmallM::Dequant` 函数中 `gmBiasOffset` 的计算方式，修复了在通信子块划分（`n_st`/`n_ed`/`n_nxt_ed`）场景下 bias 偏移不准确的问题（+6/-7 行）。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T10:54:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T10:54:43+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176848770,"discussion_id":"4f33097f6bc246416a17907ca76afebc33a10078","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=cec6b9c3be644a5897d8e952aae6165c&projectName=CANN'>cec6b9c3be644a5897d8e952aae6165c</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=cec6b9c3